	0.2					Dec.  1, 2008		Shinji Watanabe
	0.3					Dec. 12, 2008		Ryota Maruko			Added "Name" Atribute and deleted "Comment" element.
						Jan. 16, 2009		Shinji Watanabe			Added restriction to "MessageTextFormat".
	0.4					Feb. 06, 2009		Shinji Watanabe
	0.5					Feb. 10, 2009		Shinji Watanabe			Removed "Group" element.
	0.6					Apr. 06, 2009		Ryota Maruko			Changed "ModifiedInfo" element.
	0.7					Apr. 24, 2009		Shinji Watanabe			date and time format was changed to ISO8601 format.
	0.9					Aug. 19, 2009		Shinji Watanabe			Added "ExtraData" element (optional)
	1.0					Sep. 11, 2009		Shinji Watanabe			no change
	1.1					Nov. 21, 2009		Shinji Watanabe			Removed "Type" attribute from "TextRow" and added "Category" attribute
